cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "JORO-HPC: Validated Multiscale LPDM-ABM Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Multiscale mechanistic simulator of the invasion of Trichonephila clavata (Joro spider)
  in North America. It couples a 3D Lagrangian particle dispersion model driven by hourly
  ERA5 reanalysis (SYCL, Intel Arc GPU) with a physiologically structured agent-based
  demographic model (OpenMP, AVX-512) on a 5 km equal-area grid (EPSG:5070, PostGIS), with
  multi-start simulated-annealing calibration (2014-2019) and a frozen blind
  out-of-sample validation (2020-2024).
type: software
version: 1.0.0
